💜 Youth Mental Health Day | #BuildFutureYou Today, we’re taking a moment to focus on something that matters every day - our mental health and wellbeing. This year’s theme from @stem4org is #BuildFutureYou - reminding us that we don’t need to have everything figured out. For young people, the future can sometimes feel exciting, overwhelming, uncertain - or all three at once. But you don’t need to have everything worked out. At HAB, we recognise that supporting students’ wellbeing is an important part of helping them to thrive both in school and beyond. We encourage our students to: 🌱 Take care of their mental health and wellbeing 💬 Talk to a trusted adult when they need support 🤝 Look out for and support those around them 🎯 Set positive goals and take steps towards achieving them ✨ Recognise their strengths, progress and potential Today, and every day, let’s make space for conversations about mental health and remind one another that it’s okay to ask for support. 💜 #YouthMentalHealthDay #YMHD2026 #BuildFutureYou #MentalHealthMatters #Wellbeing #HarrisBermondsey
