Our book recommendation this week as part of the #NationalYearOfReading2026 comes from Aishat! 📚 "I would like to recommend the book Once by Morris Gleitzman, which I think many young people would enjoy. The story follows Felix, a young Jewish boy who escapes from an orphanage during the Second World War. It is a powerful and emotional novel that shows the heartbreaking reality of the Holocaust through the eyes of a child. To cope with the horrors he witnesses, Felix creates imaginative stories, including one in which he saves his friend Zelda from a burning house. His optimism and courage make this a moving and unforgettable book. I would recommend Once to anyone looking for a story that is both emotional and inspiring". #education #ProudToBeHAB #student #students #teacher #london #harrisfederation #southwark #southeastlondon #southeast #bermondsey #reading #books #nationalyearofreading
