Our book recommendation this week as part of the #NationalYearOfReading2026 comes from Asseel! 📚 "I've read many books in my life, and choosing just one to recommend wasn't easy. After a lot of thought, I decided on 'The School for Good and Evil'. You might be wondering why I chose this series over so many others. For me, it's because it blends mystery, problem-solving, fantasy and romance into one unforgettable story. Every book kept me hooked and eager to find out what would happen next. More than anything, the series taught me that you have to get through the storms before you can enjoy the rainbow. It reminds us to hold onto hope, keep fighting for what's right and never give up, even when things seem impossible". #education #ProudToBeHAB #student #students #teacher #london #harrisfederation #southwark #southeastlondon #southeast #bermondsey #reading #books #nationalyearofreading
