Today, we are celebrating an exceptional set of GCSE results for our Year 11 student Gloria. Gloria has shown incredible determination and perseverance throughout Years 10 and 11, despite facing significant health challenges and undergoing major surgery in both years. Her hard work and resilience have paid off with an outstanding set of results: 🏆 Grade 9 – Chemistry 🌟 Grade 8s – Mathematics, Physics & Spanish 👏 Grade 7s – English Literature, Geography & RS 📚 Grade 6s – Biology & English Language We could not be prouder of Gloria. Her results are a testament not only to her academic ability, but to her strength, resilience and determination. A huge congratulations, Gloria - you should be incredibly proud of everything you have achieved. 🎓👏 #HarrisAcademyBermondsey #GCSEResults #ResultsDay #ClassOf2026 #ProudOfOurStudents #Resilience
