🎉 GCSE RESULTS DAY AT HARRIS ACADEMY BERMONDSEY! Today we are celebrating the fantastic achievements of our Year 11 girls as they receive their GCSE results! Our students have achieved strong passes in English and maths, well above last year’s national average and the Southwark average, with more than a third of all exams achieving Grade 7 or higher. 🌟 A huge congratulations to our highest-performing students, Rafiat, who achieved an incredible 9 Grade 9s and a Grade 8, and Mareen, who achieved 6 Grade 9s and 5 Grade 8s! 👏 Principal Gizlé Landman said: “I am immensely proud of all our Year 11 girls. They are celebrating a fantastic set of results. Having worked incredibly hard, not just in the run up to their exams, but in the years beforehand, they deserve their success today.” We are also celebrating particularly strong performances in Music, English, Spanish and French, with more than three quarters of students achieving strong passes. 📚🎶 A huge thank you to our incredible staff for their dedication and to our families for their continued support. Congratulations to the Class of 2026 - what an achievement! 🎓 #HarrisAcademyBermondsey #GCSEResults #ResultsDay #ClassOf2026 #Motivation #Inspiration #Education
