Our book recommendation this week as part of the #NationalYearOfReading2026 comes from Kirushniga!📚 "Since it's the National Year of Reading, the government has highlighted that not only are adults reading less, but so are children and teenagers. I recommend The Inheritance Games by Jennifer Lynn Barnes. It's the perfect series for young teens who want to get into reading more often. Exploring themes of romance, crime and mystery, as well as a compelling love triangle, it's the kind of book that keeps you turning the pages. Before you know it, you'll have finished the whole series! The story is packed with hidden family secrets, sibling rivalry and unexpected plot twists. As you read, you'll solve clues alongside the characters, making the mystery even more immersive. Just when you think you've figured everything out, another twist changes everything. If you enjoy fast-paced mysteries with unforgettable characters, The Inheritance Games is the perfect series to pick up". #education #ProudToBeHAB #student #students #teacher #london #harrisfederation #southwark #southeastlondon #southeast #bermondsey #reading #books #nationalyearofreading
