Congratulations to Matilda on an outstanding set of A Level results! ⭐ A* in Chemistry, A in Biology, A in Psychology 🎓 Human Neuroscience – UCL Matilda has secured a place at UCL to study Human Neuroscience from next month - a fantastic achievement and a testament to her hard work and dedication throughout her time at Harris Academy Bermondsey. Speaking about her results, Matilda said: “I am really proud of myself, and I want to thank everyone who helped me get this far.” Principal Gizlé Landman described Matilda as an exceptional student whose commitment and perseverance have been a joy to see. 👏 We are incredibly proud of you, Matilda, and wish you every success at UCL. #ResultsDay #ALevelResults #UCL #HumanNeuroscience #HarrisAcademyBermondsey
