🎉 A Level Results Day celebrations at Harris Academy Bermondsey! We are incredibly proud of our students, who are heading to some of the UK’s leading universities to study a wide range of prestigious courses, including Physics with Astrophysics at the University of Nottingham, Politics and Maths at Queen Mary University of London, and Environmental Geoscience at Cardiff University. This year’s results reflect the hard work and determination of our students, with nearly half of all entries awarded an A*, A or B. Principal Gizlé Landman said 'I am delighted to see so many students celebrating their achievements and securing places on exciting university courses". 👏 Congratulations to the entire Class of 2026 - we wish you every success in the next stage of your journey. #ResultsDay #ALevelResults #ClassOf2026 #HarrisAcademyBermondsey
